{"title":"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Kayla went to the fair with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6a1da7f18069a90481296d18af7ca979fe3854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" />. She spent <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/d/4cd0f9f9869b39e79527f9010293adf7bfe5210f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> of her <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6a1da7f18069a90481296d18af7ca979fe3854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" /> on rides, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/0/4c00e9e2066800d5a55332a7fb456073bbce0a08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> of her <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6a1da7f18069a90481296d18af7ca979fe3854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" /> on food. How much money did she spend?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/1/e71b29ff454f29be7ff548aa2e59214cb90357a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ \\$65 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\$32.50 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\$2.50 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\$50 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ \\$35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"516\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can calculate how much she spent on her rides, then the amount she spent on food, and then add them together.\n</p><p>For the rides, she spent:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbdee0013ad278902cd42e44f40a1cc72d711ca5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac14 \\times \\$100 = \\$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"125\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>For the food, she spent:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/7/1271777da529ff4018b194b3e84a7b09b72f0651.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{10} \\times \\$100 = \\$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"134\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Thus, altogether, she spent:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/1/ae1831371d442d549ef497f9ba5c72d782d98d49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$25 + \\$10 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } \\$35}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"175\" height=\"31\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can combine the fractions to see what fraction of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6a1da7f18069a90481296d18af7ca979fe3854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" /> she spent altogether:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/c/79cf2590e730a3fdef680ef3815a0014c75d312e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac14 + \\frac{1}{10} = \\frac{1 \\times 5}{4 \\times 5} + \\frac{1 \\times 2}{10 \\times 2} = \\frac{5}{20} + \\frac{2}{20} = \\frac{7}{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"341\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>We can now multiply this by the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6a1da7f18069a90481296d18af7ca979fe3854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" /> she was given to see how much she spent altogether:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/0/e80d8c5145789596117492abd22bb0e038e590a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7}{20} \\times \\$100 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } \\$35}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"179\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_8\" titl